@*
    Ben, 2026-10-01: the seven advertisements, on the home page, as 64-pixel thumbnails with the
    audience written underneath — "with the IsHaunted-flyer being for everyone".

    Deliberately static. These are seven files on disk, not a feed: no client, no loading state,
    nothing to fail at run time. What CAN fail is the files going missing, which renders as seven
    broken images and seven dead links, so FlyerStripTests fetches every one of them.

    The files are put there by docs/ads/publish-to-site.py, which copies the PDF and draws the
    thumbnail from the same build — so a thumbnail can never advertise a flyer the site is not
    serving. Changing this list means changing that script's list too; it says so there.
*@

<div class="home-band">
    <div class="ben-section-head">
        <div class="ben-kicker">Pass it on</div>
        <h2 class="ben-section-title">Tell somebody what this is</h2>
        <p class="ben-section-lede">One sheet each, front and back. Open it, print it, or send it on.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap" id="flyer-strip">
                @foreach (var f in Flyers)
                {
                    <a class="flyer" href="@($"/flyers/{f.File}")" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
                       title="@f.Title" data-flyer="@f.File">
                        <img src="@($"/flyers/thumbs/{f.File.Replace(".pdf", ".png")}")"
                             width="64" height="83" loading="lazy" alt="@($"Front page of {f.Title}")" />
                        <span class="who">@f.Who</span>
                    </a>
                }
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@code {
    private sealed record Flyer(string File, string Who, string Title);

    // "Everyone" first, and it is the whole-platform one: the other six each answer "is this for
    // me?", this one answers "what does it do?".
    private static readonly Flyer[] Flyers =
    [
        new("IsHaunted-Flyer.pdf",          "Everyone",            "Everything IsHaunted.com does"),
        new("IsHaunted-Ad-IsHaunted.pdf",   "Just curious",        "IsHaunted.com — a first look"),
        new("IsHaunted-Ad-Individuals.pdf", "Enthusiasts",         "IsHaunted for enthusiasts"),
        new("IsHaunted-Ad-Groups.pdf",      "Investigation groups","IsHaunted for investigation groups"),
        new("IsHaunted-Ad-Ghost-Walks.pdf", "Ghost walk tours",    "IsHaunted for ghost walk tours"),
        new("IsHaunted-Ad-Venues.pdf",      "Haunted venues",      "IsHaunted for venues"),
        new("IsHaunted-Ad-Event-Hosts.pdf", "Event hosts",         "IsHaunted Hosted Events"),
    ];
}
